  "hint": "Hover a part · E apart · ← → steps",
  "caption": "9 MX switches in hot-swap sockets on a 61 × 90 mm PCB, wired straight to a Raspberry Pi Pico, in a two-part printed case: the top is also the switch plate, and 4 M3 screws hold it to the tray through heat-set inserts.",
